title: "CC-REG-01: Open Claim-Checker"
version: 0.2.0
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23246074"
date-released: 2026-10-08
authors:
  - family-names: Politzer
    given-names: Brian Scott
repository-code: "https://github.com/gringomxmusic-byte/CC-REG-01"
license: MIT
keywords: [verification, reproducibility, research software, mutation testing, provenance]
abstract: >-
  Open tool that checks software-backed claims by examining evidence: it flags status
  literals that are not derived from results, detects hand-typed fake SHA-256 receipts,
  and recomputes declared file hashes and manifest roots.
